From a0d817f9410e6959b0802058191c2ee2941e501d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: prettymebenneth <prettymebenneth@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:57:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fuxi iOS 17: Bluetooth (QcaBluetooth tty, patched
 bluetoothd union and launch constraint), keychain, GPU and display probes

- drivers/QcaBluetooth: WCN7850 Bluetooth over GENI UART, H4 at 3.2 Mbaud, /dev/uart.bluetooth and cu.bluetooth tty nodes
- ios17-zaudio-hal-mount.patch: addon btd/ union over /usr/sbin for the patched bluetoothd
- zz-btd-launch-constraint.patch: launch constraints skipped only for the bindfs bluetoothd
- zz-msg-probe / zz-btd-oslog-probe / zz-task-sample-probe: bluetoothd syscall, message, notification and thread probes
- zz-calendar-hook.patch: settimeofday reaches the board RTC offset
- submodules: Adreno740/AdrenoMetal/GopFramebuffer present and recovery fixes, fixed 120 Hz, AppleKeyStoreState software wrapping
